# Gilded Skull Cove's pirates' sea cave (CIPlay gilded_skull_cove_cave, 11-12 w14 prep; in a test world 'CI ...'). Points
# as in the recipe: kit_uw mouth on the sea floor at 14 -58 (pad -5; yaw 335: way in = -x +z), tunnel 29.1 m up 15 degrees
# (+7.5 m), the den beyond (middle ~-3 -18.5) under the headland; air zone gs_seacave there, the chest gsseacavechest.
# 11-17 (w14E): the sea floor at the mouth is 25 m down - four flattens raise the pad to -4; 12 degrees (the tool's most), den floor ~1.8.
# 11-17 w14G: the offset re-read after the build (the new sea stack moved the land centre).
# 11-17 w14F: the cave moved (see the recipe's 11-17 FIX) - swim in under water to where the tunnel leaves the sea,
# walk the dry rest (as tiki_lagoon_cave); in-cave pictures at absolute heights.
island Gilded Skull Cove keep
offset -4.9326 -4.437
hour 11
weather Calm

empty
picture gs_seacave_out 30 6 -58.5 -16.8 3 -31.4
at 15.3 -50 h=-2
# 11-17 w14L: swims along the tunnel snagged where its floor meets the water line. As effigy_shoals_caves and
# weatherglass: swim only to the mouth, walk the tunnel floor in and out.
swim 15.3 -50 -3 to 8.4 -46 -3.5
walk 8.4 -46 to 0.6 -41.5 to -5.5 -38 to -8.6 -36.3 to -12.8 -33.8 to -16.8 -31.4 to -21.6 -28.7 to -26.3 -25.9 below=-3
air gs_seacave here
picture gs_seacave_in -16.8 4 -31.4 -26.3 3 -25.9 light=20
open Pirates' sea chest
wait 2
expect item TradeToken 3
walk -26.3 -25.9 to -21.6 -28.7 to -16.8 -31.4 to -12.8 -33.8 to -8.6 -36.3 to -5.5 -38 to 0.6 -41.5 to 8.4 -46 below=5
# (w14I: the swim out is put on its first point - at -0.8 that was under the floor (stuck); it now runs the swim in's own line back)
swim 8.4 -46 -3.5 to 15.3 -50 -2
